# lib/ is committed on purpose: profile bundles install this package straight
# from GitHub (github:/file:/link), where a `prepare` build runs only when the
# consumer's pnpm allowBuilds allowlist names this exact tarball. Shipping the
# built output is what the other GitHub-installed bundles do.
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Client sourcemaps are debugging output, not installable content.
lib/*.map
